    {
      "id": 145730,
      "name": "Darrell",
      "username": "Darrell",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/darrell/{size}/4836_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-05T03:39:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Cool. &nbsp; How did it end in a tie for first exactly?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>For the final game we had them play a full inning, starting with the 9th. That ended in a 0-0 tie, so we went to the 10th. That also ended in a 0-0 tie. So as opposed to going into the 11th, the gentlemen decided to split the victory.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:23:32.628Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
