      "raw": "<p>Well I rewatched the Video, and I still think I should have got my home run at my first at bat, it was a Strike 6, but I had a +1 power so I rolled a 6+1=7 Hit, but becuase I Rolled a Natural 6, I should still have gotten my smash, and I comfirmed it with another 6 for a Home run.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But it was alot of fun, and I am still proud to be a World Champ.</p><p>I am hopeing to Defend my title next Gen-Con.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for a great game guys I can&#39;t wait to get my Kickstarter!!!!</p>",
