      "created_at": "2015-08-06T17:46:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>That's terrible, next year's winner will now host Gen Con. &nbsp;That sounds like a reasonable solution to an unfavorable result in an exhibition intended to increase popularity of the game.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This post is gold</p>",
